  "remarks": "PJSC “Bank Uralsib” is among the leading Russian banks. The bank is active in state-backed SME financing tools, promoted by the President of the Russian Federation Vladimir Putin. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, PJSC “Bank Uralsib” is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
